WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.320
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.320
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:09.260
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:09.260
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:19.830
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.770
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.790
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.790
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.230
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.230
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.000
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.000
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.280
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.280
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.720
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.720
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:45.310
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:45.310
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:49.770
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:49.770
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:49.840
I can say love

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.570
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.570
It overflows with love.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:53.570
will you love me?

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:57.180
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:57.180
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.130
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.130
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.690
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.690
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:08.340
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:08.340
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:24.130
Put him down gently...!

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:25.700
He's really hurt bad!

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:27.460
Get a stretcher!

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.330
Are you all right?!

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:37.510
Where am I...?

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:41.680
Aboard the Kamidake, of the GP Transport Decoy Unit.

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:44.280
We caught your distress signal...

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:45.840
This box...

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:49.960
Deliver this box right away...

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.620
...to Seto-sama...

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:52.820
Seto-sama?!

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:59.220
Kamidake Seriously Damaged

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:02.530
There's no need to worry now.

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:05.500
He's very weak, but in no danger of dying.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.600
Really? That's good.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.410
So what do we do with the box?

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:14.080
What do we do? Deliver it, of course...

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.750
We've been asked to, after all...

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:17.750
I guess we have no choice.

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:21.190
Jurai isn't all that far from here.

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:23.880
Large number of gravity waves in front of us!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.230
Captain! Random jump, immediately!

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:36.830
We can easily beat this many ships!

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:38.470
Don't be reckless!

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.960
Those ships are specialized for combat!

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.880
Emergency escape!

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:56.980
Only a royal ship could survive a surprise attack like that.

00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:00.360
Hey. We tagged them with our little present, right?

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:02.990
Excellent.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:04.790
The hunt is on.

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:16.770
What is this shaking?!

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:19.180
Mass abnormalities all over the ship's hull!

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:22.270
It's dangerous for us to remain in hyperspace!

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:26.750
Damage report is in.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:30.020
Power generators, both main and sub, are down 30 percent in output.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.190
Outer armor has been deteriorated by 27 percent.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:35.060
Energy pipes and connector lines have also taken damage.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:37.490
I see...

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:40.060
We were lucky to get away like that...

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:42.470
We put some distance between us and Jurai, though.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:45.270
With him as our captain there's never a dull moment!

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:47.830
More importantly, this is the real problem!

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:50.210
It appears that due to friction during hyperspace jumps,

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:53.810
parts of the outer hull vaporize and change into mass energy...

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:55.410
There's no way we can do short-distance jumps,

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:59.080
and we would have no idea where we'd wind up after a long-distance one.

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.990
Being unable to jump into hyperspace is a real problem...

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:03.190
What's more...

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:06.590
...it appears long-distance hyperspace communications have been jammed!

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:08.590
Can't you fix that?

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:10.390
Not here.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.860
In that case...

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.360
We also need a reliable medical team...

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:16.530
Let's head for a nearby station!

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:23.240
First let's carry the injured man to the medical ward.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.210
Then we can repair the ship...

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.610
Emergency escape!

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:38.690
Who would have guessed they were waiting to ambush us?

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:41.660
So first the injured man, then repairs...

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.160
Not again!

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:01.580
Why?!

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:11.260
With all these battles one after another, we're almost out of supplies...

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:13.520
How many ships have we lost...

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:16.330
It's definitely a new record...

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.160
No matter how much we fix them, they still break...

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:21.470
I haven't slept in 3 days...!

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:23.670
None of us have...

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.430
We're gonna die if this keeps up...

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:30.070
Not again!

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:36.910
So now we're at the last of our food, too...

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:40.010
Just leave us alone!

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:45.960
Thank you for earlier!

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:48.690
I didn't like his way of doing things. That's all.

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:51.400
Plus I owed one to the boy.

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:54.800
Seiryo-kun is Seina-kun's teacher.

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.700
I would appreciate it even more if you gave him back too...

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:00.100
You're as nonchalant as ever...

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:04.370
I might agree to it if you were to release 100 of my colleagues in return.

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:06.380
I'll think it over.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:08.010
Bye.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:10.340
What's the matter?

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:12.780
What did you say?!

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.630
Airi-sama...

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:30.960
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:49.820
Enough is enough, Captain!

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:51.660
We've all worked extremely hard!

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.890
Let's just hand over the box!

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:57.160
But it's our duty to deliver the goods we're given...

00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:00.560
Aren't we a decoy unit?!

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:03.700
You give up that easily and yet you call yourselves GP officers?!

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:06.170
If you think of it as a diet you can endure it!

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:08.710
Come on...

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:11.640
The captain and Amane-san are right...

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.280
Calm down and think about it.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:16.580
The pirates really want their hands on that thing.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.380
Plus it's meant for Seto-san!

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:24.250
If we can safely deliver it, we're sure to get a warm and erotic reception!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:27.120
Erotic...?

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:28.760
Eat up!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.330
And when you're done...!

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:34.100
Eat us up, too...!

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:36.330
Let's hurry, Captain!

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:37.700
OK...

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:40.140
Men are such simple-minded creatures.

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:44.870
Alright! Starting now, our ship is participating in Operation: Diet!

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.480
Operation...?

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.820
Can't we just give it to them?

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.010
Just endure it!

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.060
Can't we just surrender?

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:02.530
Just endure it!

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:13.640
Endure it! Endure it!

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:15.910
Even I have my limits!

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.140
Calm down, Amane-san!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.410
Does it look like I can calm down?!

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:25.850
Look! I'm even starting to hallucinate!

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:27.820
Mitoto-san...?

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:34.450
Am I hallucinating too...?

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:40.330
What about relief ships?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:43.030
What's the stupid GP doing?!

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:45.940
I'm continually transmitting distress signals,

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.070
so let's hang in there a little longer.

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:50.340
You're amazing, Kiriko-san!

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.600
It's like you're not affected at all!

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:57.380
Kiriko-san!

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:00.350
Please listen!

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:03.490
In order to solve our dangerous food shortage,

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:09.060
I have devised a groundbreaking method to turn 1 cracker into 2!

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:13.020
You place the cracker in your hand like so, and then...

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:21.740
See! Now we have 2 crackers!

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:27.740
Physical laws make it impossible to increase the amount of food!

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:32.270
In which case, shouldn't we be fine if we don't get rid of our waste?!

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:39.420
Just go to the bathroom already!

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:43.690
Not releasing our waste is physiologically impossible!

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:47.960
In which case, shouldn't we be fine if we re-consume our waste instead?!

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:55.010
However, putting your own waste in your mouth is a little...

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:58.370
Then why don't we eat Amane-san's and Kiriko-san's delicious waste?!

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:02.180
It's sensual, all right! It's the real...

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:08.150
Single pirate ship approaching!

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:09.350
A single ship...?

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:11.820
This may be our only chance...

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:14.520
Rob food from the pirates!

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:17.160
Attack!

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:18.920
Not you too, Amane-san...

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:30.940
Help!

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:35.880
This... is the end...

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:41.120
Not good. If this keeps up we can't have our erotic welcoming on Jurai...

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:42.980
W-what are you doing?!

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.390
Ow...!

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:53.390
I'll teach 'em to eat me!

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:59.200
Bingo...

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:21.490
And that would be?

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:24.830
The box you guys were tryin' to steal.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.930
I suffered a lot to bring it here.

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.700
What do you want for it?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.670
I'm glad you asked!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:32.700
Lemme think...

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:34.040
First, some girls.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.310
And then some girls.

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:39.140
And then... more girls.

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:43.240
The GP's got some pretty messed up robots...

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:44.380
Fine.

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:59.400
Now this is the life!

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:02.170
Captain! We've undone the box's protection.

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:03.570
Excellent!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:06.360
Now I can show myself in front of Tarant-sama...!

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:17.780
What's the big idea! Bounce me around more!

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.650
Did I do something wrong?

00:12:29.490 --> 00:12:32.060
Um, why are we...?

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:36.170
After all, we don't know when rescue will come for us...

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:40.370
And besides, everyone does this to keep each other warm when stranded...

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:42.170
I think this is a little different...

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:43.970
Seina...

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:45.410
Y-yes?

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.910
If we die...

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:48.850
...eat our...

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:51.280
...crackers.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:53.720
No, I could never...

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:55.490
It's all right.

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:58.350
We want you to live, Seina-chan...

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.900
You'll pay!

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:12.870
Another attack?

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:15.740
How dare you trick me!

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:16.740
When did you...!

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:20.110
Hand over the box or else!

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:21.810
Pirate vessels in our path!

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:23.350
They're exiting their jumps!

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:25.110
Not good! We're surrounded!

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:30.920
You ain't runnin' this time!

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:34.660
Your engine is at its limits! Isn't it, Captain?

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:38.060
Well, I'm not as cruel as you might think...

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:40.130
So I'll spare all the women!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:43.400
Though I'll work them hard for the rest of their lives!

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:44.570
Damn you!

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:46.040
Damn you?

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:48.070
You best watch your tongue.

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:51.670
Your life is in my hands!

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:55.380
Amane! Exactly what kind of software did you install in him?!

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:57.580
You won't get away with this!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:59.340
So what will it be?!

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:04.990
Hurry and answer the question!

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.990
What will it be?! Eh?

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.630
What's with that guy?

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:12.260
I've never seen anyone so nasty...

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:17.770
Come on, hurry up or we'll start shootin'!

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:21.270
W-what's going on?!

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:23.600
Seina-sama!

00:14:34.050 --> 00:14:36.150
I'm here to help, Seina-sama!

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:38.210
Ryoko-sama!

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:41.550
We're going to shake the enemy vessels off!

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:45.630
Stop firing!

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:47.100
Don't shoot!

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:56.510
The enemy ships are getting away!

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:57.810
After 'em!

00:14:57.810 --> 00:15:00.310
They're on their way to Jurai!

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:02.610
Let's go after 'em so we can get those women back!

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:03.650
We're after the box!

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:06.480
Huh? Oh, we can get the box too while we're at it.

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:14.960
Thank you, Ryoko-san!

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:16.660
You saved us!

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:20.100
No, I didn't do much...

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:23.290
I would do anything for you, Seina-sama...

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:24.830
Ryoko-san...

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:27.530
Seina-sama...

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.430
Ryoko-san...

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:33.840
Okay, break it up, you two!

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:36.210
Thanks for bringing the supplies, Ryoko-san...

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:39.700
Yeah. Your job is done now so leave...

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:42.580
What?

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:49.190
Airi-sama ordered me to assist you in fulfilling your mission.

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.460
Hurray!

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:53.030
Is that all right with you?

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:56.130
Of course! We'd appreciate it!

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:57.800
Thank you.

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:59.860
Think nothing of it!

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:11.310
This feels so wonderful!

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:16.590
How many days has it been since my last shower, I wonder?

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:20.060
I guess we can thank Ryoko for this at least...

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:21.960
I agree...

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.890
Thank you.

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:28.330
Thanks to you everyone was taken in as refugees.

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:31.700
I didn't do anything big enough to be thanked for...

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:33.260
No, you did!

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:41.580
And to show you my gratitude, I will serve you for my entire life!

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:43.680
I will do anything!

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:45.250
So...

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:46.680
So...!

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:49.210
Please allow me to be at your side!

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:57.690
Or... do you hate me?

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:01.130
Um, uh, it's not like that...!

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.970
I'm so happy!

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.700
What are you doing?

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:07.500
No, this isn't what it...!

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:10.500
We can't even take a simple shower!

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:16.510
Large number of ships detected ahead!

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:17.410
Pirates!

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:20.410
And we were so close to entering Juraian territory!

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:24.480
The Daidalos...?!

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:26.880
Tarant!

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:30.590
Tarant...

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:35.830
I won't let you escape this time...

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:37.670
Seina Yamada.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:40.040
What's with that fancy showoff ship?!

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:43.340
Fool! That ship belongs to Tarant-sama!

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:46.380
Bah! Butting in when we were so close...

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:47.680
What's wrong?

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:50.810
He'll kill us this time if we fail!

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:53.680
Don't worry, just leave it to me!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.150
What do we do, Seina?!

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:58.450
Break through the enemy ships and head for Juraian space!

00:17:58.450 --> 00:17:59.490
Roger!

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:00.920
Let's do it!

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:05.360
Ryoko. Gather everyone on your ship onto the Kamidake.

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:07.930
We're going to use your ship as a screen!

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:09.300
What about the ship's controls?

00:18:09.300 --> 00:18:10.400
I'll take care of it!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.370
Amane's in charge of tactical!

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:15.140
Then I'll support the piloting here!

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:16.470
Please do!

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:23.380
Take this!

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:25.350
The enemy ship is coming right at us!

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:27.320
Use the Gaizu as a shield.

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:32.550
Captain! We've lost control of our ship!

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:34.520
Someone's controlling it from the outside!

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:35.690
What?!

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:37.790
I'll be seeing you!

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:39.590
NB! You...!

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:50.930
Now! Escape while they're blinded by the explosion!

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:05.480
Excellent. Seize everyone onboard.

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.620
It's all over now.

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:13.500
Who's meowing out here?!

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:21.640
W-what the...?!

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.310
That's...!

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:24.740
Ryo-Ohki!

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:39.220
Why is that ship...?!

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:41.620
Danger! Retreat!

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:51.190
All the pirate vessels have fallen silent!

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:52.840
Amazing!

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:54.770
Help me!

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:57.470
I don't mind stabbing but I don't like being stabbed!

00:19:57.470 --> 00:20:01.340
Though it does feel strangely pleasant...

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:06.550
What a situation I wound up in...

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:10.050
Who was going to work us hard?!

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:11.350
No, no!

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:13.520
I was just pretending to help them so they would let their guard down!

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:16.550
But never mind that, I brought a guest!

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:22.200
Huh? Isn't she Tenchi-senpai's...

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:25.300
Thanks for saving us, Ryo-Ohki-chan!

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:26.640
Ryo-Ohki?!

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:30.500
That's right! She's the Ryo-Ohki's organic computer!

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:34.110
This girl's a spaceship...?!

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:37.580
The Masakis mentioned something about that, but I never paid attention...

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.750
And Mihoshi didn't say anything about it at all...

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:43.320
She and the others are classified top secret, after all...

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:44.590
This is exciting!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:48.320
To think that I would get to meet the legendary pirate ship, Ryo-Ohki!

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:51.090
She's legendary? Amazing, isn't she?

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:51.990
Of course!

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:55.900
She's the ship that fought evenly matched against Jurai all by herself!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:21:00.670
My name also comes from Ryo-Ohki's captain, Ryoko-sama...

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:04.270
I knew it. I wondered why I didn't like your name...

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:08.010
Ryoko? Would that be someone Tenchi-senpai knows...?

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:08.850
Yes.

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:13.480
That reminds me, Ryoko-san isn't with you today?

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:15.650
So today you're all by yourself?

00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:17.820
Really? That's too bad...

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:23.360
She must have been an amazing person!

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:27.300
Oh, so Professor Washu asked you to go on an errand all the way to Jurai?

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:30.900
You're such a good girl!

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:34.890
Captain! Escort vessels from Jurai have arrived.

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:51.990
OK, all that's left now is the delivery!

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:55.530
Let's hurry and deliver it so they'll give us a warm, erotic reception!

00:21:55.530 --> 00:21:59.830
After all, we went through a lot of suffering to deliver it!

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:01.460
Am I wrong about something?

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:06.870
Ow! Don't be putting your high heels in my wound! It might get stuck!

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:09.100
Stop!

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.740
uchuu de saitei saiaku

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.740
You're the worst, most hopeless,

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:26.860
un warui Unlucky Boy

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:26.860
most unlucky boy in space.

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:34.070
anna koto shite te mo

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:34.070
No matter what you do,

00:22:35.090 --> 00:22:36.800
konna koto shite te mo

00:22:35.090 --> 00:22:36.800
no matter what you do,

00:22:37.070 --> 00:22:41.590
otozureru jiko tensai sugoi wana

00:22:37.070 --> 00:22:41.590
you can't escape the accidents, disasters and traps

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:43.880
anata wa nigerarenai

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:43.880
that come your way.

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:47.450
keikai shite te mo

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:47.450
Even if your really careful...

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.160
ikinari shichatte mo

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.160
And even if you're not...

00:22:50.420 --> 00:22:56.390
saitei saiaku dame dame no

00:22:50.420 --> 00:22:56.390
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:22:56.390 --> 00:23:00.860
anata wa doshiyou mo nai

00:22:56.390 --> 00:23:00.860
You're a lost cause.

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:10.810
anata ga saitei saiaku

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:10.810
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:15.430
anata wa Unlucky Boy

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:15.430
You're an unlucky boy.

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:20.510
dakedo anata shika mienai

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:20.510
But all I can see is you,

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:26.030
sonna anata shika mienai

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:26.030
just the way you are.

00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:34.150
We somehow escaped danger and made our way to Jurai.

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:38.250
We safely delivered the package and could probably take a short break,

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:40.550
but when the box was opened...

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:42.390
And then there's Ryoko-san's secret...

00:23:42.390 --> 00:23:44.190
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:45.390
On Jurai
